hifiberry-aes67 (0.3.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Do not seed the latency when config-server is unreachable.
    seed_latency could not tell 'unset' from 'unreachable', so an
    agent starting while config-server restarted overwrote the
    user's chosen latency with the board default.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 06 Aug 2026 18:00:00 +0200

